        {
          "content": "Ho Chi Minh City",
          "fill": "#3C3C40",
          "fontSize": 10.5,
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "Dear Lumi\u00e8re hiring team,",
          "fill": "#111111",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": null,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "I'm applying for the Junior Marketing role because Lumi\u00e8re writes about skin the way students actually talk about it, and I want to help do more of that.",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "At my campus beauty club I interviewed 40 skincare buyers and turned what they said into three TikTok scripts that reached 28,000 views. Last summer at a local startup I wrote 24 product posts; the best one brought 180 sign-ups in a week.",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "I'd bring the same habit to Lumi\u00e8re: listen first, write short, measure what works. I can start in March, three days a week.",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "Thank you for reading. My CV and a short write-up of my checkout study are attached.",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "Warm regards,",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": null,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "Linh Nguyen",
          "fill": "#2F2F31",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "lineHeight": null,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": null,
          "startsLine": true
        },
        {
          "content": "Missing keyword",
          "fill": "#1A1A1A",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "lineHeight": null,
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": null
        },
        {
          "content": "The job asks for Meta Ads. Add it if you've used it.",
          "fill": "#59595B",
